<title>JAPAN: Argentina launches 50 bln yen 5.0% samurais - Nikko.</title>
<headline>Argentina launches 50 bln yen 5.0% samurais - Nikko.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following samurai bond issue was announced by lead manager Nikko Securities on Thursday:</p>
<p>BORROWER Argentina</p>
<p>    AMT	50 bln yen</p>
<p>    COUPON   5.0 pct</p>
<p>    MATURITY 20 Dec 2002  </p>
<p>    TYPE		samurai</p>
<p>    ISS PRICE	 par</p>
<p>    PAY DATE	  20 Dec 1996</p>
<p>    SUB PERIOD	Dec 16 to Dec 19</p>
<p>    PAY FREQ	  Semi-annual</p>
<p>    LAST RATING     S&amp;P BB-, Moody's B1</p>
<p>    LEAD MANAGER    Nikko Securities</p>
<p>    LEAD TRUSTEE    Long-Term Credit Bank</p>
</text>
